      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Of course, let's get this plan rolling with a little bit of that good old-fashioned, pre-symposium hustle and bustle. Picture this: the sun peeking over the horizon, the first rays of dawn casting a golden glow over Geneva, as we prepare for the grand opening of our medical symposium.\n\n6:00 AM - The clock strikes six, and our keynote speaker, a renowned figure in the medical community, begins their journey. Picture them arriving at the venue, greeted by a team of eager assistants, ready to whisk them away to their designated prep area. It's a scene straight out of a fairy tale, with the speaker's arrival heralding the start of a day filled with knowledge and discovery.\n\n6:30 AM - As the morning dew still clings to the ground, our team of tech wizards gets to work. They meticulously test the audiovisual equipment, ensuring that every word spoken by our esteemed speaker will be heard clearly by all attendees. It's like tuning a fine instrument, where every note must be perfect.\n\n7:00 AM - With the AV setup complete, we turn our attention to the coffee setup and catering. Picture a bustling kitchen, where chefs and servers work in harmony, preparing a feast fit for the gods. Fresh",
      "source": "target",
